1
00:02:25,086 --> 00:02:26,294
呀啊啊!
Aahhh!

2
00:02:29,253 --> 00:02:31,044
你们太厉害了
You guys were incredible.

3
00:02:31,378 --> 00:02:34,711
你们居然在没有提前计划作战的情况下打败了那只灵鬼
Oh, the way you took down that Geist without needing to plan your tactics out

4
00:02:34,753 --> 00:02:36,711
你们的战斗直觉好强
you just knew exactly what to do.

5
00:02:36,753 --> 00:02:40,211
金牌特工是为了能完美协同作战而精挑细选出来的
Well, Ace-Ops are hand-picked to perfectly complement one another.

6
00:02:40,253 --> 00:02:43,336
这样我们就可以不用考虑自己的弱点去专心做擅长的事
So we can focus on our assets and leave our liabilities behind

7
00:02:43,378 --> 00:02:46,628
我们有些人甚至没有弱点
Some of us are all asset, zero liability

8
00:02:47,794 --> 00:02:50,961
什-- 是吗?你觉得我有弱点吗 埃姆?
Wha-- Yeah? Think I've got some liabilities, Elm?

9
00:02:51,378 --> 00:02:52,878
你的脑子就是个弱点
Your brains, for one.

10
00:02:57,669 --> 00:02:59,003
你自己问的
You did ask.

11
00:03:02,086 --> 00:03:04,419
嗨 你需要新闺蜜吗
Hi. Do you need a new best friend?

12
00:03:04,461 --> 00:03:05,836
我们的cp名可以是
Our pair name can be -

13
00:03:06,044 --> 00:03:09,128
雷霆腿瓜子!
THUNDER THIGHS!

14
00:03:10,336 --> 00:03:13,128
完美的互补合作 啊 没错
Perfect complementary teamwork. Oh, yeah.

15
00:03:13,169 --> 00:03:15,128
我也希望能像你们一样帮助到我的朋友们
I wnt to have my friends' backs just like that.

16
00:03:15,961 --> 00:03:16,919
朋友们?
Friends?

17
00:03:17,461 --> 00:03:20,294
哈哈 这里可不是学校操场 小屁孩
Ha ha, this isn't the schoolyard, kid.

18
00:03:20,836 --> 00:03:22,669
雷霆腿瓜子.
Thunder thighs...

19
00:03:23,878 --> 00:03:26,586
但如果你与某人共同经历了这么多的事情
But, I mean, when you go through so much with someone

20
00:03:26,669 --> 00:03:28,336
这经验的确会改变一些东西 不是吗?
it kind of changes things, doesn't it?

21
00:03:29,044 --> 00:03:30,628
的确 我们能和谐相处
We got along well enough, sure.

22
00:03:30,794 --> 00:03:32,378
我指望着他们不让我送命
I count on them to keep me alive.

23
00:03:32,669 --> 00:03:34,628
他们也是如此 但这只是工作
They do the same. But that's the job.

24
00:03:35,169 --> 00:03:36,628
这两者是有区别的
We don't confuse the two.

25
00:03:40,128 --> 00:03:41,628
说起工作
Speaking of the job...

26
00:03:42,669 --> 00:03:43,753
好的 长官
Yes, sir.

27
00:03:45,086 --> 00:03:47,628
任务从不停歇 你们都稍微等一下
Duty ever beckons. You all hang back a second.

28
00:03:49,211 --> 00:03:51,461
现在就报告吗 长官?
Briefing already, sir?

29
00:03:52,378 --> 00:03:54,461
等回到擎天后你们想做些什么?
What do you guys want to do when we get back to Atlas?

30
00:03:54,669 --> 00:03:57,169
观光?哦 我们该先去哪儿看看呢?
Sightseeing? Oh, what should we visit first?

31
00:03:57,211 --> 00:03:59,169
先去看看我们的床如何?
How about our beds?

32
00:03:59,211 --> 00:04:02,128
但是各位!这是个多好的去探险的机会啊
Oh, come on, guys! This is a great time to go exploring.

33
00:04:02,336 --> 00:04:03,878
我们都好久没这么做了
We haven't done that in so long.

34
00:04:04,003 --> 00:04:09,378
Ruby 在到这里之前 我们已经徒步探索了一整块大陆了
Ruby, we just explored a whole continent on foot before flying to this one.

35
00:04:09,419 --> 00:04:12,919
虽然是这样 但那都是探索里最无聊的部分
Well, yeah. But it was only the boring parts.

36
00:04:13,169 --> 00:04:14,086
我们差点死掉
We almost died.

37
00:04:18,586 --> 00:04:20,503
喂 注意了
Hey. Heads up.

38
00:04:21,961 --> 00:04:23,294
能请队长们来这儿集合一下吗?
Can I get the team leaders over here?

39
00:04:23,586 --> 00:04:24,878
我想跟你们商量些事
There's something I'd like to discuss with you.

40
00:04:25,253 --> 00:04:26,253
包括你 克罗
You too, Qrow.

41
00:04:27,669 --> 00:04:30,086
我需要你们去地上行动 但要保持低调
I need you on the ground, but be subtle.

42
00:04:30,836 --> 00:04:33,669
如果民众看见太多猎人容易引起慌乱
If people see too many Huntsmen milling around they'll get nervous.

43
00:04:36,919 --> 00:04:39,836
还有 别带马罗去
And Clover? Don't take Marrow.

44
00:04:45,169 --> 00:04:46,836
曼特城又有新问题了?
New problems in Mantle?

45
00:04:47,919 --> 00:04:49,586
很不幸 仍跟之前的一样
More of the same, unfortunately.

46
00:04:49,961 --> 00:04:53,544
有人在曼特城连续清除掉了反对擎天的运动领头人
Someone in Mantle is taking out public leaders who speak out against Atlas.

47
00:04:53,919 --> 00:04:56,169
具体点说 是带头反对我的人
Specifically, people who speak out against me.

48
00:04:56,836 --> 00:04:58,544
刚开始时我们并没看出规律
It didn't look like a pattern at first.

49
00:04:58,878 --> 00:05:01,294
但这是过去这一周里的第三起谋杀了
But this is the third murder of its kind in the last week.

50
00:05:02,961 --> 00:05:07,128
等等 那不是在我们被捕后跟我们一起被押运的男人吗
Wait a minute. That's the guy that rode with us after we were arrested.

51
00:05:08,378 --> 00:05:09,128
他死了?
He died?

52
00:05:09,544 --> 00:05:14,169
你在曼特城的反对者一个接一个的被杀 的确让你的形象不太好看 对吧?
Your opposition in Mantle dropping dead isn't exactly a good look for you, huh?

53
00:05:14,336 --> 00:05:16,794
我并不是那么在意自己的公众形象
Not really worried about my public image,

54
00:05:17,211 --> 00:05:18,669
但这已引起民心的混乱
but it is causing unrest.

55
00:05:19,128 --> 00:05:20,794
我想有人是想诬陷我
I think someone's trying to frame me

56
00:05:20,836 --> 00:05:25,419
顺带着擎天一起诬陷 并且已经起作用了
and by extension, Atlas. And it's working.

57
00:05:26,336 --> 00:05:28,711
嗯 如果不是因为尘晶禁令让大家都如此生气
Well, if it wasn't for the embargo making everybody so mad,

58
00:05:28,753 --> 00:05:31,669
民众也不会这么快就把所有事都怪到你头上啊
people probably wouldn't be so quick to blame you for everything else.

59
00:05:34,211 --> 00:05:35,419
咳咳 长 长官
S-sir.

60
00:05:37,003 --> 00:05:39,419
不 不 你是对的
No. No. You're right.

61
00:05:40,336 --> 00:05:43,586
近期曼特城的事变得有些 难以管理
Things in Mantle have been... hard to manage lately.

62
00:05:44,044 --> 00:05:45,544
我也并不是对这些问题视而不见
I'm not blind to its issues.

63
00:05:45,628 --> 00:05:47,711
其实 这正是我想跟你们说的事
In fact, that's what I want to talk to you about.

64
00:05:49,211 --> 00:05:53,169
在这座通讯塔成功发射 而曼特城的局势也缓解之后
With the launch of this mobile communications tower and tensions down in Mantle,

65
00:05:54,253 --> 00:05:56,461
我想你们的队伍能帮我们很大的忙
I think there's a lot of good your teams can do here.

66
00:05:59,503 --> 00:06:02,544
什么?已经来了?这里?
What? Already? Here?

67
00:06:03,211 --> 00:06:05,669
不 没事 让他着陆
No, it's fine. Let him land.

68
00:06:06,003 --> 00:06:07,628
我会亲自对付他
I'll deal with him myself.

69
00:06:09,044 --> 00:06:10,961
又有曼特城的问题了?
More Mantle problems?

70
00:06:12,044 --> 00:06:16,336
不 这个是擎天的问题
No. This one's an Atlas problem.

71
00:06:23,753 --> 00:06:25,336
是我没弄清楚吗 詹姆斯
So let me get this straight, James.

72
00:06:25,378 --> 00:06:29,669
除了你那破禁令影响我做生意之外
In addition to this nonsensical embargo of yours crippling my business,

73
00:06:29,711 --> 00:06:34,044
你还觉得你有权利去征用私人领土?
you've also decided you have the authority to commandeer private property?

74
00:06:34,669 --> 00:06:36,419
等议会知道这事儿
When the Council hears about this,

75
00:06:36,461 --> 00:06:37,253
你可就完--
you will never -

76
00:06:37,294 --> 00:06:38,711
其实 我已经通知他们了
Actually, I've already informed them.

77
00:06:39,211 --> 00:06:42,419
既然这里现在已经是军方的机密任务基地
As this is now the site of a classified military operation,

78
00:06:42,628 --> 00:06:43,961
这事甚至连投票表决都省了
it didn't even require a vote.

79
00:06:44,211 --> 00:06:46,169
连投票都省了?
Didn't require a vote?

80
00:06:46,586 --> 00:06:50,044
在输掉下一次的选举前 你真应该好好复习一下议会明文了 杰克
You might want to brush up on Council law before you lose this upcoming election, Jacques.

81
00:06:50,586 --> 00:06:53,211
我这次让你在这儿着陆是出于礼貌
Now. I've allowed you to land here once as a courtesy.

82
00:06:53,378 --> 00:06:55,461
如果还有下次 我们可就不会这么友善了
the next time, it won't a friendly reception.

83
00:06:56,628 --> 00:07:00,336
你近期好像忘了你真正的朋友究竟是谁
Lately, you seem to forget who your friends really are.

84
00:07:00,628 --> 00:07:02,961
我会在议会拥有一席之地的 詹姆斯
I'm going to get that council seat, James,

85
00:07:03,003 --> 00:07:04,294
或许到那时你会--
and maybe then you'll --

86
00:07:07,836 --> 00:07:08,461
你
You..

87
00:07:09,836 --> 00:07:13,378
你把我失踪的小女儿也绑到了你这个阴谋里来了?
You roped my missing daughter into these schemes of yours, too?

88
00:07:13,669 --> 00:07:15,003
她回擎天多久了?
How long has she been back in Atlas?

89
00:07:15,044 --> 00:07:16,003
温特知道这件事吗?
Did Winter know about this?

90
00:07:16,044 --> 00:07:17,419
我是自愿来这里的
It was my decision to come here.

91
00:07:18,294 --> 00:07:20,336
就像我当初是自愿离开的一样
Just like it was my decision to leave.

92
00:07:21,294 --> 00:07:23,128
还是说您已经忘了?
Or have you forgotten all about that?

93
00:07:23,753 --> 00:07:25,961
姑娘 如果你觉得我是个会忘记任何事的人
If you think I'm one to forget anything, girl,

94
00:07:26,003 --> 00:07:28,628
你可就看错你父亲的为人了
then you've misjudged the man your father is.

95
00:07:28,878 --> 00:07:32,628
相信我 我可一直很清楚您的为人
Believe me, I know exactly the kind of man you are.

96
00:07:32,669 --> 00:07:34,544
你怎么敢这么对我说话?
How dare you speak to me that way?

97
00:07:34,669 --> 00:07:35,586
我已经有点想--
I have half a mind to --

98
00:07:35,628 --> 00:07:37,586
有点想做什么 杰克?
Half a mind to what, Jacques?

99
00:07:43,128 --> 00:07:47,294
你知道吗 你离开时你母亲被压垮了
You know, your mother was devastated when you left.

100
00:07:49,086 --> 00:07:51,253
几天都不愿意离开房间
Didn't leave her room for days.

101
00:07:51,461 --> 00:07:55,878
你也知道她难过时会做些什么
You know how she gets when she's upset.

102
00:08:02,753 --> 00:08:06,169
我早就知道你总有一天会涉足自己不该碰的领域
I knew one day you would overextend your reach.

103
00:08:07,419 --> 00:08:10,544
我来这儿不是为了求回一座废弃矿山的
I didn't come here to beg for an abandoned mine.

104
00:08:11,836 --> 00:08:13,253
我是来感谢你的
I came here to thank you.

105
00:08:14,961 --> 00:08:18,211
感谢你亲手为我送上吊你的绞索
For personally handing me the noose to hang you.

106
00:08:23,461 --> 00:08:25,169
你会后悔的
You'll regret this.

107
00:08:27,628 --> 00:08:31,211
这些就是你抛弃一切追随的朋友们?
So these are the little friends you threw everything away for?

108
00:08:31,836 --> 00:08:34,794
不是朋友 是家人
Not friends. Family.

109
00:08:54,419 --> 00:08:56,086
你还真是姗姗来迟啊 温特
Oh, now you show up, Winter.

110
00:08:56,378 --> 00:08:57,878
你正好错过了父亲
You just missed Father.

111
00:08:58,294 --> 00:08:59,919
也不能说是我错过了父-
I wouldn't say I missed hi-

112
00:09:00,336 --> 00:09:00,794
啊!
Ah!

113
00:09:01,044 --> 00:09:02,086
惊喜!
Surprise!

114
00:09:04,669 --> 00:09:06,919
呃 我们还没开始吗?
Uh, did we not start yet?

115
00:09:07,419 --> 00:09:10,544
啧 读读空气 很明显啊
Ugh. Apparently, we haven't.

116
00:09:11,503 --> 00:09:12,378
开始什么?
Start what?

117
00:09:16,253 --> 00:09:21,044
不用说也知道 这座场馆对于我们来说都有着非凡的意义
It goes without saying that this arena holds a significance to all of us

118
00:09:21,669 --> 00:09:24,544
我们今天在这里集合是最合适的
It's only fitting that we should be able to reconvene here.

119
00:09:24,961 --> 00:09:28,586
现在 当世界最需要团结在一起时
Now. When the world needs to be brought together more than ever

120
00:09:29,836 --> 00:09:31,794
从我们相遇那天算起
the road you traveled from our first meeting

121
00:09:31,836 --> 00:09:32,544
你们走过的路并不简单
hasn't been easy.

122
00:09:33,128 --> 00:09:35,503
在信标 你们为了你们的校园和朋友而战
You fought for your school and your friends at Beacon.

123
00:09:36,419 --> 00:09:38,294
你们在避风港学院
You fought for the world and the innocent

124
00:09:38,336 --> 00:09:39,669
为了世界和无辜的人们而战
at Haven Academy and beyond.

125
00:09:40,419 --> 00:09:43,211
你们面对旁人无法理解的恐怖
You faced down terrors people can't even fathom.

126
00:09:44,211 --> 00:09:45,961
这些已经不是学生的行为了
That's not the behavior of students.

127
00:09:46,461 --> 00:09:47,711
这是...
It's the behavior....

128
00:09:48,211 --> 00:09:50,253
猎人们的所作所为
Huntsmen and Huntress

129
00:09:59,128 --> 00:10:01,961
等等 这是什么
Wait, what is this?

130
00:10:02,211 --> 00:10:07,044
在今夭 你们被授予猎人执照
granted your Huntsmen

131
00:10:07,586 --> 00:10:09,336
我知道这有点操之过急
I know this is coming a little ahead of schedule,

132
00:10:09,753 --> 00:10:11,294
但是兄弟会知道这是你们应得的
but Brothers know you deserve it.

133
00:10:11,753 --> 00:10:13,836
对于没有让这个场合变得更有仪式感
I only regret that I couldn't do something

134
00:10:13,878 --> 00:10:16,169
我深表遗憾
a little more ceremonious for the occasion.

135
00:10:16,794 --> 00:10:18,961
我 我们...
I -- we...

136
00:10:19,503 --> 00:10:21,544
埃隆伍德将军 我们很荣幸
we're honored, General Ironwood.

137
00:10:21,878 --> 00:10:23,378
但是您真的没必要这...
But you really don't have to do th-

138
00:10:23,794 --> 00:10:25,378
收下吧 塞伦的的威胁依然存在
Please. With the threat of Salem still out there

139
00:10:25,628 --> 00:10:27,461
而且国内紧张局势不断升级
and tensions rising in our kingdom,

140
00:10:28,044 --> 00:10:30,836
在我身边 我必须要拥有更多值得信赖的战士
I certainly could use more trustworthy fighters by my side.

141
00:10:31,503 --> 00:10:33,378
拥有你们的帮助是我的幸运
I should beso luckyto'have all of you.

142
00:10:37,086 --> 00:10:39,169
所以没关系 这是一个重要时刻
It's okay. It's a big moment.

143
00:10:39,794 --> 00:10:41,586
还有什么是比在这里庆祝更好的?
And what better way than to celebrate here?

144
00:10:42,503 --> 00:10:43,836
当这座通讯塔准备就绪
When this tower is ready

145
00:10:43,961 --> 00:10:45,919
通讯能够恢复的时候
and communications are back up and running,

146
00:10:46,086 --> 00:10:47,461
我们将告诉全世界关于塞伦的事情
we'll tell the world about Salem

147
00:10:47,503 --> 00:10:50,961
然后让我们一起 来面对接下来发生的事情
and face down whatever comes at us after that, together.

148
00:10:57,336 --> 00:10:59,711
这些就是我要说的全部了
That's just about all the pomp I have in me.

149
00:11:00,753 --> 00:11:01,711
如果你们不介意的话
If you'll excuse me,

150
00:11:01,753 --> 00:11:03,503
我要回去工作了
I have to get back to running this operation.

151
00:11:03,794 --> 00:11:06,836
呃 那么 去享受蛋糕吧
Um.. Well then, enjoy the cake.

152
00:11:11,294 --> 00:11:13,628
你的演讲结语有很大改善呐 将军
Your speech outros are improving, sir.

153
00:11:14,128 --> 00:11:16,044
在我们经历了这么多事情之后
After everything we've been through,

154
00:11:16,211 --> 00:11:18,503
我几乎都忘了这是我最初想要的东西
I almost forgot this is what I wanted in the first place.

155
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:20,169
在信标陷落之后
When Beacon fell,

156
00:11:20,211 --> 00:11:22,169
我甚至认为已经不可能拿到执照了
I didn't think this would even be possible.

157
00:11:22,836 --> 00:11:24,919
现在甚至觉得有点不值一提
It almost feels trivial now.

158
00:11:25,294 --> 00:11:27,628
放轻松 高兴点
Jeez, guys, lighten up a little.

159
00:11:27,794 --> 00:11:29,628
享受改变的乐趣吧
Enjoy yourselves for a change

160
00:11:29,836 --> 00:11:30,878
这是你们应得的
You've earned it.

161
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:33,128
终于 有人说了
Finally! Someone said it.

162
00:11:33,503 --> 00:11:35,128
那我们快去吃蛋糕吧
Let's kill some cake, huh?

163
00:11:35,336 --> 00:11:37,961
我可以在Ren吃完一块之前就干掉两块
Because can eat two slices before Ren even eats one.

164
00:11:38,211 --> 00:11:39,169
谁说我不行?
Who says I can't

165
00:11:39,211 --> 00:11:40,503
谁说的 啊?
Who says it, huh?

166
00:11:40,836 --> 00:11:43,711
Nora 没人在和你争
Nora, nobody is arguing with you about this.

167
00:11:44,419 --> 00:11:45,711
哇
Ooooh!

168
00:12:01,669 --> 00:12:03,336
对你来说是个大日子吧 小鬼
Big day for you, huh, kiddo?

169
00:12:03,753 --> 00:12:06,628
这 确实需要时间消化一下
It's... definitely a lot to take in.

170
00:12:06,878 --> 00:12:10,169
适应什么 终于到达擎天的事
Which part? The finally getting to Atlas part,

171
00:12:10,419 --> 00:12:11,669
获得猎人执照的事
getting your license part,

172
00:12:11,711 --> 00:12:14,794
还是对埃隆伍德有所隐瞒的事?
or the not quite disclosing everything to Ironwood part?

173
00:12:15,711 --> 00:12:17,711
还是 以上全部?
Or... all of the above?

174
00:12:19,294 --> 00:12:20,753
以上全部
All of the above.

175
00:12:21,461 --> 00:12:24,211
我在努力做我认为最好的事情
I'm trying to do what I think is best

176
00:12:24,378 --> 00:12:28,169
但是我分不清什么是好的什么是对的
but I really can't tell if what's best is what's right.

177
00:12:28,544 --> 00:12:30,044
或者说我和奥兹之间没有区别
Or if I'm no different from Oz.

178
00:12:30,294 --> 00:12:34,336
Ruby 奥兹只信任他自己一个人
Ruby, Oz only trusted himself with the whole truth.

179
00:12:34,794 --> 00:12:36,336
你还信任别人
You're trusting others,

180
00:12:36,836 --> 00:12:38,836
不过你能确保他们是值得信任的
but you're making sure they prove themselves first.

181
00:12:39,294 --> 00:12:42,128
我觉得这是一个很大的区别
I think that's a pretty big difference.

182
00:12:42,461 --> 00:12:43,544
希望如此吧
I hope so.

183
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:46,628
这上面说我已经是一个女猎人了
This says I'm a Huntress now.

184
00:12:47,419 --> 00:12:50,128
但是我不觉得我比在信标的时候懂得更多
But 'don't feel like I know much more than I did at Beacon.

185
00:12:51,711 --> 00:12:54,211
这种感觉一直都会在的
That feeling never goes away.

186
00:12:55,544 --> 00:12:59,211
你的妈妈 Summer 会为你感到骄傲的
Your mom, Summer, would be proud of you.

187
00:13:03,419 --> 00:13:05,253
她最后一个任务
Her last mission...

188
00:13:05,794 --> 00:13:07,544
是奥兹的另一个秘密吗?
was that another Oz secret?

189
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:10,544
嗯 我们那时候有很多秘密
Hm. There were a lot of those back in our day.

190
00:13:12,044 --> 00:13:13,836
不过那个是Summer的秘密
But this one was a Summer secret.

191
00:13:14,503 --> 00:13:15,836
当她没有回来的时候
When she didn't come back,

192
00:13:16,586 --> 00:13:19,753
奥兹平看起来和我还有你爸爸一样毫无头绪
Ozpin seemed just as in the dark as myself and your father.

193
00:13:20,961 --> 00:13:24,586
然而 谁知道这些年来他隐瞒了多少事情
Still, who knows what he may have hidden from us over the years.

194
00:13:26,169 --> 00:13:27,711
你觉得 当她知道塞伦的真相的时候
What do you think she would have done

195
00:13:28,669 --> 00:13:30,253
她会怎么做?
if she learned the truth about Salem?

196
00:13:31,253 --> 00:13:32,794
就塞伦无法被毁灭这件事?
That she can't be destroyed?

197
00:13:34,128 --> 00:13:37,044
藏在心里 我觉得 和你一样
Pressed on, I think. Like you.

198
00:13:37,878 --> 00:13:39,919
她一直是我们几个里最优秀的那个
She was always the best of us.

199
00:13:41,378 --> 00:13:42,794
尽管有点淘气
Bit of a brat though,

200
00:13:43,211 --> 00:13:44,378
但是 嘿 我喜欢淘气的
but, hey, I like brats.

201
00:13:46,544 --> 00:13:48,878
嘿 Ruby 来看看这个
Hey Ruby! Come check this out.

202
00:13:51,419 --> 00:13:53,711
哦天哪 这个是任务板?
Oh my gosh, is that a mission board?

203
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:55,169
它现在是个App了?
It's an app now?

204
00:13:55,211 --> 00:13:56,711
我们可以骑歌利亚巨象吗?
Can we ride a Megoliath?

205
00:13:56,753 --> 00:13:58,419
或者阻止一个地下犯罪团伙?
Stop an underground crime ring?

206
00:13:58,461 --> 00:14:00,711
还是说我要去做..卧底?
Do I get to go... undercover?

207
00:14:01,128 --> 00:14:03,128
可...能..!
Maaaybeee!

208
00:14:03,169 --> 00:14:04,711
嘿 你们有闻到吗?
Hey, you guys smell that?

209
00:14:06,419 --> 00:14:09,044
闻起来像是 新鲜的肉
Smells like fresh meat.

210
00:14:10,794 --> 00:14:13,086
那奇怪了 我没闻到肉的气味
That's odd. I don't smell meat.

211
00:14:14,878 --> 00:14:16,211
我也没有
Neither do I.

212
00:14:16,586 --> 00:14:18,294
呃 你们知道吗?算了无所谓
Ugh. You know what? Nevermind.

213
00:14:18,628 --> 00:14:20,086
让我来理一下
Let me get this straight.

214
00:14:20,336 --> 00:14:22,503
你们才刚刚转正一个小时
You've only been official for an hour now

215
00:14:22,544 --> 00:14:24,794
就开始找猎人工作了?
and you're already looking for Huntsmen work?

216
00:14:24,836 --> 00:14:29,461
确切地说 我们转正有整整57分钟了
To be fair, we've been official for a whole 57 minutes!

217
00:14:29,836 --> 00:14:31,044
我得提醒你们一句
I'd like to remind you all

218
00:14:31,211 --> 00:14:33,044
这里的主要任务是要确保
that the real mission here is ensuring

219
00:14:33,086 --> 00:14:35,461
通讯塔的成功发射
the successful launch of the communications tower.

220
00:14:35,669 --> 00:14:37,628
确实 但是我们也需要通过做力所能及的事
True, but we can also keep training

221
00:14:37,711 --> 00:14:38,919
来得到锻炼和提升
and improving by helping where we can.

222
00:14:39,961 --> 00:14:42,128
年轻人的活力!
The enthusiasm of youths.

223
00:14:42,169 --> 00:14:44,336
好吧 不和你们争了
Well, it's hard to argue with that.

224
00:14:44,794 --> 00:14:46,878
让我展示一下这个是怎么用的
Okay, let me show you how it works.

225
00:14:47,503 --> 00:14:48,919
噢 这里有个重要任务
Ooh. Here's an important one.

226
00:14:49,169 --> 00:14:50,169
有谁自愿吗?
Who wants to volunteer?

227
00:14:50,211 --> 00:14:51,336
好!好的!
Yes! Alright!

228
00:14:51,544 --> 00:14:53,169
我们需要有人来护送孩子们
We need someone to escort children to

229
00:14:53,211 --> 00:14:55,169
到曼特城的学前班上学
pre-primary school down in Mantle.

230
00:14:55,461 --> 00:14:57,086
事实上那里没什么危险
There's not actually any danger,

231
00:14:57,128 --> 00:14:59,419
但是父母很担心 这会吸引戮兽
but the parents fret and that attracts Grimm.

232
00:15:00,794 --> 00:15:02,419
很好 谢谢
Perfect, thanks.

233
00:15:02,961 --> 00:15:06,044
胡安... 华安... 珍?
Juan... Jwan... Jim?

234
00:15:07,086 --> 00:15:08,503
基本算说对吧
Close enough, I guess.

235
00:15:08,919 --> 00:15:11,253
哇 我的第一个猎人任务
Wow, my first Huntsmen mission.

236
00:15:12,419 --> 00:15:16,294
下一个 一只巨大的剑魔齿虎在曼特城的下水道逃窜
Next, a massive Sabyr is loose in the Mantle sewers.

237
00:15:16,753 --> 00:15:19,836
我们需要两位勇猛的战士来干掉它
We need two brave warriors to flush it out.

238
00:15:20,711 --> 00:15:23,753
什么? 但是...为什么我不能选那个任务?
Wha--? But -- Why didn't I get a choice for that one?

239
00:15:37,419 --> 00:15:40,461
父亲 你 呃 有位访客
Father, you, um... have a visitor.

240
00:15:41,044 --> 00:15:43,711
我不是告诉过你我不想被打扰吗
I told you I didn't want to be disturbed.

241
00:15:43,961 --> 00:15:44,753
你怎么还是让他们进来了?
Why did you let them in?

242
00:15:44,794 --> 00:15:47,794
我没有 是他把自己放进来了
I didn't. He let himself/in.

243
00:15:48,878 --> 00:15:51,794
这个小伙子有点你的样子 杰克
A spitting image of you, this lad, Jacques.

244
00:15:52,419 --> 00:15:53,794
尽管有些吓人 我还是要加一句
Creepily so, I might add.

245
00:15:54,294 --> 00:15:58,294
他绝对有继承你的... 气场
He's definitely inherited your... affect.

246
00:15:59,878 --> 00:16:03,211
亚瑟 让我们两个单独呆一会儿 惠特利
Arthur. Whitley, leave us.

247
00:16:03,419 --> 00:16:04,419
记得把门关上
And shut the door.

248
00:16:06,669 --> 00:16:07,878
我说了 把门关上!
I said shut the door!

249
00:16:12,003 --> 00:16:15,294
我 你不是应该已经死了吗
I-- You're supposed to be dead.

250
00:16:15,669 --> 00:16:18,128
这就是我想让人们相信的
That is what I wanted people to think.

251
00:16:18,169 --> 00:16:18,919
你说对了
You're right.

252
00:16:19,836 --> 00:16:23,586
然而 我也听说了很多你的事情 杰克
However, I've heard things about you too, Jacques.

253
00:16:23,878 --> 00:16:27,711
直接地说 你和埃隆伍德之间有点问题
Namely, that you have an Ironwood problem.

254
00:16:28,378 --> 00:16:32,003
因为那混蛋的尘晶禁运令 我每天损失都很大
That bastard is costing me more money every day with this embargo.

255
00:16:32,253 --> 00:16:33,961
如果我不需要他们的选票来竞选议员的话
I'd lay off every employee in Mantle

256
00:16:34,086 --> 00:16:37,003
我早就裁掉在曼特城的所有员工了
if I wasn't trying to get their damn votes for this Council seat.

257
00:16:38,336 --> 00:16:43,878
如果我说 你可以保住你的饭碗 又可以拿到好处呢?
What if I said you could have your cake, and eat it too?